      "type": "list_item",
      "source": "`items`: An array of result items, each an [`NSExtensionItem`](nsextensionitem.md) object, to return to the host app.",
      "normalizedSource": "`items`: An array of result items, each an [`NSExtensionItem`](nsextensionitem.md) object, to return to the host app.",
